---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Design System
---
<section class="section wrapper flow">
  <h1>Proses Design System</h1>
  <p class="hero__lede">
    Catatan tentang bagaimana saya membangun dan mendokumentasikan
    design system — dari token, komponen, sampai keputusan trade-off.
  </p>
  <div class="grid">
    {% for item in collections.designSystem %}
      <a class="card" href="{{ item.url }}">
        <h2 class="card__title">{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="card__meta">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
